  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4602.57 “New Hampshire auction account (NHAA)” means an account administered by the regional organization for purposes of auctioning CO2 budget allowances.\n\nSource. #9283, INTERIM, eff 10-1-08, EXPIRED: 3-30-09\n\nNew. #9444, eff 4-3-09 (from Env-A 4602.58); ss by #10468, eff 1-1-14 (from Env-A 4602.52); ss by #12967, eff 1-1-20 (from Env-A 4602.58)",
